WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:05.506 --> 00:00:08.425
Hey! Too far!
It's ominous down there!

2
00:00:08.509 --> 00:00:10.969
So go get it ominously!

3
00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:16.725
It's okay. little girl.
We'll take it from here.

4
00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:18.602
Actually.
we'll take it from here.

5
00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.521
Actually.
we'll take it from here.

6
00:00:20.604 --> 00:00:22.523
Gentlemen!
We'll take it from here.

7
00:00:22.606 --> 00:00:23.941
Who's that?
What did he say?

8
00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:26.443
He's FBI!
He says he'll take it from here!

9
00:00:26.527 --> 00:00:27.903
He can say that all he wants.

10
00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:29.613
but we tend to take it
from here.

11
00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.240
-Every time.
-Not this time.

12
00:00:31.323 --> 00:00:32.533
Wait. Troy. what the hell?

13
00:00:32.616 --> 00:00:34.535
Sorry. Bob.
I've always been MIB.

14
00:00:34.618 --> 00:00:36.495
Yes. but you've never been
Majestic Level.

15
00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:38.372
-Hank. what the hell?
-Sorry. Tyler.

16
00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:40.791
Okay. Wow. I guess you guys
are taking it from here.

17
00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:42.584
You think I'm taking
anything from anywhere

18
00:00:42.668 --> 00:00:44.044
with this guy ever again?

19
00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:45.527
Good point.
Why don't you two pricks

20
00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:46.856
just take everything
from everywhere?

21
00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:47.923
What do you think?

22
00:00:48.006 --> 00:00:50.926
You want to take it from here?
With me?

23
00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:53.345
My whole life. I've been
taking things from places.

24
00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:54.721
Today it's from here.

25
00:00:54.805 --> 00:00:56.390
tomorrow it'll be God knows what

26
00:00:56.473 --> 00:00:57.849
from God knows where.

27
00:00:57.933 --> 00:01:00.477
Just once.
I'd like to give it from here.

28
00:01:00.561 --> 00:01:03.313
to someone
who can take it anywhere...

29
00:01:03.397 --> 00:01:05.774
That's beautiful. gentlemen.
but unnecessary.

30
00:01:05.857 --> 00:01:07.234
Troy. Bob. Hank. Tyler.

31
00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:08.235
-Yes. sir.
-Mister President. Sir.

32
00:01:08.318 --> 00:01:10.445
-We'll take it from here.
-Is that the President?

33
00:01:10.529 --> 00:01:12.364
I-I can't hear anything
that's going on.

34
00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:13.508
We thought we were
taking it from here...

35
00:01:13.532 --> 00:01:14.717
My partner of 15 years
just revealed...

36
00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:15.927
-but the President is!
-they're a stranger!

37
00:01:15.951 --> 00:01:17.011
I refuse to take this
personally.

38
00:01:17.035 --> 00:01:18.304
but I will never trust
anyone again!

39
00:01:18.328 --> 00:01:19.788
I couldn't parse most of that.

40
00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:22.583
so I'm assuming the Coast Guard
is taking it from here?

41
00:01:22.666 --> 00:01:23.959
